  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to support the implementation of programme estimates with the Rwanda Development Board (RDB) and the National Institute of Statistics of Rwanda (NISR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Technical Assistance to support the implementation of programme estimates with the Rwanda Development Board (RDB) and the National Institute of Statistics of Rwanda (NISR) - The overall objective is to improve the availability, accessibility and integration of reliable statistics into policies and strategies promoting investment across potential economic sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
